# Copy this file to .env.local (which is gitignored and never committed)
# and fill in your real key. Get a key at https://console.anthropic.com/
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# Optional -- overrides the default model id in anthropicModelClient.ts
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=

# Optional -- lets VocAligner compare models via OpenRouter (openrouter.ai)
# Get a key at https://openrouter.ai/keys
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=

# Optional -- looks up a song's real key to correct Pitch Correction's rootNote/scale
# instead of trusting the model's guess. Falls back to the model's guess if unset.
# Get a key at https://getsongbpm.com/api (requires a live backlink to getsongbpm.com
# on your site first).
GETSONGBPM_API_KEY=

# Optional -- lets generated vocal chains (and the Artist+Song cache) survive across
# Vercel's serverless instances via Upstash Redis, instead of an in-memory store that's
# local to a single instance. Without these, /api/generate still works (falls back to
# in-memory), but a result can silently 404 if a later request lands on a different
# instance -- fine for local dev, not for production.
# Set automatically if you add the Upstash integration from the Vercel Marketplace
# (Storage tab in your Vercel project); no need to fill these in by hand for a
# Vercel-provisioned database. Set manually only for local dev against a real Upstash
# database, from https://console.upstash.com/.
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=
